  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1410.10 Replacement of Rigging and Equipment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1410.10 Replacement of Rigging and Equipment.\n\n(a) At least one set of replacement equipment for the following items shall be available on site at all times:\n\n(1) Bungee cords;\n\n(2) All ropes;\n\n(3) Rigging hardware;\n\n(4) Bindings and ankle strapping for jumpers;\n\n(5) Jump harness; and\n\n(6) Safety harnesses.\n\n(b) Items of equipment, rigging, or personal protective equipment found to be in non-compliance with the rules shall be replaced prior to continued operation.\n\n(c) Jumping shall cease immediately when an item that is found to be out of compliance with the rules cannot be replaced.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400) #5607, eff 4-2-93, EXPIRED: 4-2-99\n\nNew. #7000, eff 5-25-99 EXPIRED: 5-25-07\n\nNew. #8964, INTERIM, eff 8-20-07; ss by #9079, eff 1-28-08; ss by #11151, eff 8-11-16; ss by #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
